filldraw((0,-1)--((0,-1)+(2,0))--(2,0)--cycle,white,gray);[/asy] Now, note that $(\lceil x\rceil -\lfloor x\rfloor)$ and $\{x\}$ are exactly equal. We can re-write the equation as \begin{align*}
